  "description": "The Multistreet 3 Fitness is ready to go anywhere with you. With racing genes and a wide range of uses. Based on a lightweight, stiff 6013 T6/2 Altanium aluminium frame. In combination with a high-quality carbon fork, this bike represents the basis for many years of riding enjoyment. Agile handling, internally routed cables and smooth seams top of the stylish frame. The Shimano GRX810 groupset used is just as attractive: Designed to cope with the stresses of cross country riding and gravel stunts, it promises best performance and a long service life. ROSE’s exquisite carbon seat post as well as the ergonomic grips and a comfortable, lightweight saddle are also a great choice. The bike’s elegant, hand laced ROSE R Thirty wheels are perfectly true and will get the bike rolling! * approx. 9.65 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for matt black/shiny grey/shiny red frame, 19”, without pedals",
